    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where It All Began</strong> invites you into a rich, immersive world as an interactive visual novel that marks the beginning of an expansive universe.\u00a0<br><br>It\u2019s a journey of reconnection, healing, and triumph over past traumas, all while navigating the rise of a criminal empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, the game explores essential themes like mental health, ambition, and the power of love. The narrative shines through its meticulous worldbuilding, deep interpersonal connections, and an unforgettable cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Where It All Began</strong>, you\u2019ll face the challenges of forgiveness, rekindle lost relationships, and find yourself entangled in a high-stakes world of romance, loyalty, and underworld intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make weaves a story of self-discovery, passion, and transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For SteamDeck Users!\u00a0<br><br>If you don't have your own controller layout for Visual Novels yet, I created one that you can find under &quot;Community Layouts&quot;.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where It All Began</strong> invites you into a rich, immersive world as an interactive visual novel that marks the beginning of an expansive universe.\u00a0<br><br>It\u2019s a journey of reconnection, healing, and triumph over past traumas, all while navigating the rise of a criminal empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, the game explores essential themes like mental health, ambition, and the power of love. The narrative shines through its meticulous worldbuilding, deep interpersonal connections, and an unforgettable cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Where It All Began</strong>, you\u2019ll face the challenges of forgiveness, rekindle lost relationships, and find yourself entangled in a high-stakes world of romance, loyalty, and underworld intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make weaves a story of self-discovery, passion, and transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For SteamDeck Users!\u00a0<br><br>If you don't have your own controller layout for Visual Novels yet, I created one that you can find under &quot;Community Layouts&quot;.\u00a0</p>",
